<title>USA: Dole Food sees Q3 at low end of forecasts.</title>
<headline>Dole Food sees Q3 at low end of forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>WESTLAKE VILLAGE, Calif. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dole Food Co Inc said it expects third quarter results to be &quot;in line with the lower end of analysts' estimates.&quot;</p>
<p>He said however, results will still be &quot;significantly above last year.&quot;</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say which analyst estimates it was referring to, although the mean estimate of a group of analysts surveyed by First Call is for third quarter net income of $0.44 per share. That compares with a $0.27 profit in the 1995 third quarter.</p>
</text>
